<title>USA: Pioneer Financial Services Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Financial Services Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAUMBURG, Ill. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 0.87		    $0.66</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.70		    $0.59</p>
<p> Net			 10,432		    7,336</p>
<p> Revs		     243,956		  214,071</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	11,932		   10,404</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	16,457		   12,722</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 results include realized investment gains of $2.1 million vs $1.4 million.  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.69		    $2.44</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.16		    $1.85</p>
<p> Net			 30,456		   20,968</p>
<p> Revs		     887,905		  800,084</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	11,114		    7,839</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	15,654		   12,608</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year results include charge of $295,000 for preferred stock redemption in 1996 and bond conversion expenses of $3.4 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Year results include realized investment gains of $2.8 million vs $2.6 million.</p>
<p>Diluted oper share results were $0.57 vs $0.48 for the Q4 and $2.01 vs $1.91 for the year. Primary oper shr results were $0.70 vs $0.52 for Q4 and $2.46 vs $2.55 for the full year.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
